WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.663
Entropy duality fails.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.268
Polarity swaps bodies; the cube's dual is

3
00:00:05.268 --> 00:00:07.737
the diamond. Pietsch guessed coverings survive it.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.628
Rows sit far apart, but the columns

5
00:00:10.628 --> 00:00:12.455
are easy to list: the counts split.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.169
Claimed: they differ by any factor.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.127
Main theorem Lean-checked.
